      "source": [
        "## If you do not see your latest results\n",
        "Open the dashboard sidebar and upload the `rr_auction_outputs.zip` generated by the modelling notebook. The dashboard expects the ZIP to contain `rr_player_rankings.csv`, `rr_auction_recommendations.csv`, `rr_pressure_delivery_events.csv`, `rr_win_probability_validation.csv` and `rr_inferred_match_results.csv`.\n",
        "\n",
        "For a local run instead, extract the dashboard package, install `requirements.txt`, and run `streamlit run app.py`."
      ]
    }
